l concentration of 50 μM. The mixture was shaken for 24 h using an automated shaker and allowed to stand for 2 h. Aliquots from the octanol phase and the aqueous phase were extracted and analyzed using the UV–vis detector to determine their relative concentrations in each phase. The measurements were repeated three times for each complex."}],"ccdc":["EFUROQ"]}